
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#fdf8fc">
  <title>Cura Companionship | Coming Soon</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Cura Companionship offers caring home and community support in the Pendle area. Our website is coming soon.">

  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #fffafd, #f4edf9);
      color: #62578c;
      text-align: center;
    }

    main {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 620px;
    }

    .logo {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 320px;
      height: auto;
      margin: 0 auto 25px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(27px, 5vw, 38px);
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .tagline {
      font-size: 17px;
      color: #8a6b9f;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .divider {
      width: 65px;
      height: 3px;
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      background: #e9adce;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 23px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .message {
      max-width: 470px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      color: #655f70;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 45px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #8a8294;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main>
    <img
      src="Cura%20(11).png"
      alt="Cura Companionship"
      class="logo"
    >

    <h1>Caring Support, Close to Home</h1>

    <p class="tagline">Companionship and support in Pendle</p>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <h2>Our website is coming soon</h2>

    <p class="message">
      We're currently working on our new website.
      In the meantime, we're looking forward to sharing
      more about our home and community support services
      with you soon.
      <br><br>
      Thank you for your patience.
    </p>

    <footer>
      Cura Companionship
    </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
